  "solution": {
    "text": "Due to inert pair effect, the stability of $+2$ oxidation state increases as we move down this group. \n$\\therefore \\mathrm{SiX}_2 \\ll \\mathrm{GeX}_2 \\ll \\mathrm{SnX}{ }_2 \\ll \\mathrm{PbX}_2$\nHence, (C) is correct."
